  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/66021322c4054e8ca385aecbc4099a75"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Programs for Corporates & Professionals",
      "highlightParagraph": "Our custom-tailored programs are designed to meet the unique needs of corporates and professionals by providing practical and easy-to-implement tools to enhance mental clarity, emotional balance, and overall well-being.",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>In today’s professional life, the demands of deadlines, meetings, and high expectations   often lead to stress and burnout. Achieving a healthy work-life balance can feel challenging.</p>\n<h3>Through our tailored workshops, the corporates will learn how to:</h3>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/0828102db281402a87ef572186620493"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Reduce Stress and Improve Emotional Stability",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "9bdc99b1-9b94-49d7-9e6a-06ecdb958046",
          "mediaKey": "8e2801fe-ce5d-405f-b83b-c013dff4404e"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Cultivate mindfulness practices to manage workplace stress, preventing burnout and fostering emotional balance.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a698c5885cdf40dfa9eb65922a9e5386"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Promote Overall Health and Well-Being",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "460df254-1e40-46d7-99bc-40d30c0130c5",
          "mediaKey": "fdae9ec5-c707-4ecd-8b7d-cc578e6f5f12"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Offer wellness programs focused on meditation, mindfulness practices to enhance physical, mental, and emotional health.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/26ee856dfbff4e1dbe55b812f4ab25e3"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "0.250",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Foster Better Work-Life Balance",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "d5d263d9-9c8e-4a1b-b529-a98c3306d2ff",
          "mediaKey": "8fd0bc06-5c11-431c-9af9-6a395c30bca0"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Integrate mindfulness techniques into your daily routine to create a healthier work-life balance.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/30309df9c7654bab87947f530b4eb6f3"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Develop Ethical Leadership",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "c6eed47e-0297-42ff-9edb-d174ae3030bf",
          "mediaKey": "8fbbfb68-483c-46ac-b7a1-edbe5d81c52f"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Incorporate meditation to develop empathy, active listening, and better communication, fostering effective and ethical leadership within the workspace.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/390c1b5f619447c4965cd0d9c8b8978e"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/514adf6e10054f538c608b3fa54731dd"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "8d2c4841-d8ff-493b-8928-eae9f1b49496",
          "mediaKey": "85c6232d-fb8f-4930-bbdc-ee8fadbece53"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "1",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "1",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Whether you are a <strong>leader</strong>, <strong>a staff member</strong>, <strong>or part of a larger organization team</strong>, <strong>BEHF</strong> is here to support in cultivating more mindful, productive, and fulfilling work environments.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/6c6ad8bbe6bd4148b9874af670ee0e40"
    }
  ],
